xes #86532 fixes #85372 (all variations of the same issue)\r\n(could also close #42161, but no way to test)\r\n\r\nWhen packing a tree of nodes to a PackedScene, signal connections were getting saved twice in some circumstances, when they should have been ignored.\r\n\r\nSee [PR update below](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100965#issuecomment-2640084435) for a better explanation of the problem and solution.\r\n\r\n### PR history\r\nI originally made PR #97303  which was partially reverted by #100235 because it inadvertently caused #100097. \r\n\r\n~~This fixes #48064 without causing #100097 using @kobewi's [suggestion from 100097](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100097#issuecomment-2524154756).~~\r\n\r\n~~It changes the line committed in #66289 which fixed 66154 to use `GEN_EDIT_STATE_MAIN` instead of `GEN_EDIT_STATE_INSTANCE`, I've verified this change does not reopen #66154~~","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2024-12-31T01:25:36Z","updated_at":"2026-02-07T12:34:51Z","closed_at":"2025-09-28T15:51:13Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"RandomShaper","id":11797174,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzk3MTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11797174?v=4","grav